units metal
atom_style atomic
dimension 3
boundary p p s
newton on

variable a equal 3.300
variable nx equal 20
variable ny equal 20
variable nzp equal 20
variable nzt equal 40
variable gaplen equal 15.0
variable gap equal v_gaplen/v_a
variable lz equal v_nzp+v_gap+v_nzt

lattice bcc ${a} orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1

region box block 0 v_nx 0 v_ny 0 v_lz units lattice
create_box 1 box
region proj block 0 v_nx 0 v_ny 0 v_nzp units lattice
region targ block 0 v_nx 0 v_ny v_nzp+v_gap v_lz units lattice
create_atoms 1 region proj
create_atoms 1 region targ
group projectile region proj
group target region targ

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix nvt all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
run 100000
unfix nvt
reset_timestep 0

variable vimp equal 20.0
velocity projectile add 0.0 0.0 v_vimp

fix nve all nve
run 200000